---
description: Stop when an issue is not agent-ready
alwaysApply: true
---

Before implementing, confirm the request has a single testable outcome, named scope, named human-only boundaries, and acceptance checks.

If product facts, legal text, financial claims, or assets are missing, report the gap. Do not fabricate them.

Required local verification when code changes: `npm run verify:local`. Record the
result in the pull request. Do not rely on cloud agents or pull-request/push CI.
